  "title": "Creamy Polenta with Roasted Corn and Fresh Sage",
  "description": "Coarse-ground cornmeal is transformed into polenta when simmered with milk and water. The polenta is served with fresh sage and grated Parmesan. It can also be made in advance, chilled for 2 hours, and then lightly fried in butter.",
  "authors": [
